{"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\{\\{Robin!"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 213, "parameters": [11, 3, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]Ah! You remembered.\\. Thank you, not many "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["actually call me that. Most simply refer to me"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["as 'that evil guy' or 'that bastard'."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 213, "parameters": [-1, 5, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Yeah well I'm not most people."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]Oh of that I'm well aware!\\."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["You've already collected two of the six "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["orbs in such a short time. Far faster "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["than I was expecting. "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 5, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Why are you doing this?\\. What's the point?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 213, "parameters": [11, 3, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]Hmm. I would say...boredom."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["The real world is a boring place, don't "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["you agree?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["No."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]But surely you can't deny "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["you've had fun playing my little game?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I was a little too preoccupied with "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["defending my life to 'have fun'."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]Pity, I thought you might be different."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["You have potential. You're one of the few"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["being proactive about escaping! So many"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["others have already given up."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]They've realised this world "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["can be the paradise I designed it to be."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["You just have to let it. So why fight?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Because...\\.someone has to. Sure there are "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["people who are happy here, but so many "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["more aren't. They won't fight themselves, "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["then someone has to fight for them."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]Well isn't that a change of "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["tone.\\. What happened to 'I'm not going to get "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["myself killed, or worse, trying to save "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["someone from their own problems.'"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 6, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["...how long have you been watching me?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]I watch everyone \\n[1]."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I watch for people like you. I watch to see"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["the one who fight."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Original Player Face", 4, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Well I guess I've had a change of heart "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["since then. I've seen a lot of people "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["hurt by this world you've created. \\."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["Every fantasy world needs a hero."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]And a villain.\\. A role which "]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["I am happy to play. Don't you think?"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 213, "parameters": [8, 5, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 205, "parameters": [8, {"repeat": false, "skippable": false, "wait": false, "list": [{"code": 45, "parameters": ["self_switch(\"A\",true)"]}, {"code": 3, "parameters": []}, {"code": 0, "parameters": []}]}]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 505, "parameters": [[{"code": 45, "parameters": ["self_switch(\"A\",true)"]}, {"code": 3, "parameters": []}, {"code": 0, "parameters": []}]]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 505, "parameters": ["self_switch(\"A\",true)"]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["PXE Faceset", 1, 0, 2]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["You certainly seem to revel in it."]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 213, "parameters": [11, 1, false]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 101, "parameters": ["Evil", 3, 1, 1]}, {"indent": 0, "code": 401, "parameters": ["\\fn[Doctor Glitch]\\fz[14]Ah, your Personal Xanadu "]}, {"inden